{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#cor:dc-ch5-2-5","title":"cor:dc-ch5-2-5","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields.md","line":131,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields.tex#cor:dc-ch5-2-5","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#prop:dc-ch5-2-4]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#def:dc-ch5-2-1]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields.tex","label":"cor:dc-ch5-2-5","line":301,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[exponential differential as a Jacobi field]\n  \\label{cor:dc-ch5-2-5}\n\n  \\uses{prop:dc-ch5-2-4, def:dc-ch5-2-1}\n\n  \\dcref{ch5:2.5}\n  Let $\\gamma:[0,a]\\to M$ be a geodesic and put $p=\\gamma(0)$. Then a Jacobi field\n  $J$ along $\\gamma$ with $J(0)=0$ is given by\n\n  $$\n  J(t)=(d\\exp_p)_{t\\gamma'(0)}(tJ'(0)),\\quad t\\in[0,a].\n  $$\n\n\\end{corollary}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</div></section>[exponential differential as a Jacobi field] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636f723a64632d6368352d322d35\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh05_JacobiFields%23prop%3Adc-ch5-2-4\">↗ prop:dc-ch5-2-4</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh05_JacobiFields%23def%3Adc-ch5-2-1\">↗ def:dc-ch5-2-1</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch5:2.5</span></span>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\gamma :[0,a]\\to M$\">$\\gamma :[0,a]\\to M$</span> be a geodesic and put <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p=\\gamma (0)$\">$p=\\gamma (0)$</span>. Then a Jacobi field <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$J$\">$J$</span> along <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\gamma $\">$\\gamma $</span> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$J(0)=0$\">$J(0)=0$</span> is given by <p></p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  J(t)=(d\\exp _p)_{t\\gamma &#x27;(0)}(tJ&#x27;(0)),\\quad t\\in [0,a].  \\]\">\\[  J(t)=(d\\exp _p)_{t\\gamma &#x27;(0)}(tJ&#x27;(0)),\\quad t\\in [0,a].  \\]</span> <p></p>","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#prop:dc-ch5-2-4","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#rem:dc-ch5-2-6","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#prop:dc-ch5-2-4","title":"prop:dc-ch5-2-4","label":"prop:dc-ch5-2-4"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#def:dc-ch5-2-1","title":"def:dc-ch5-2-1","label":"def:dc-ch5-2-1"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#prop:dc-ch5-3-5","title":"prop:dc-ch5-3-5","label":"prop:dc-ch5-3-5"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch05_JacobiFields#prop:dc-ch5-3-9","title":"prop:dc-ch5-3-9","label":"prop:dc-ch5-3-9"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-general","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-general","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer-general"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer","label":"lem:dc-ch8-2-1-jacobi-norm-transfer"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch08_SpacesOfConstantCurvature#lem:dc-ch8-2-1-exp-norm-transfer","title":"lem:dc-ch8-2-